":219},"aXoeKhAAACQAVOmN","belizon","\u002Fexpedition\u002Fbelizon","expedition","https:\u002F\u002Fnico-mathieux.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=afshxhAAACIAY-3t&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aXoeKhAAACQAVOmN%22%29+%5D%5D",[211,212],"Amazonie","Guyane","2026-01-28T15:26:20+0000","2026-01-28T16:43:37+0000",[216],"piste-de-belizon",[],[],{"title":220,"date":221,"place":212,"gpx_file":222,"gpx_color":5,"youtube_link":228,"slices":231,"meta_title":337,"meta_description":338,"meta_image":339},"Piste de Belizon","2025-11-13",{"link_type":66,"key":223,"kind":68,"id":224,"url":225,"name":226,"size":227},"69e55990-67a5-4fac-b603-304924022e5b","aXoelgIvOtkhCCWF","https:\u002F\u002Fnico-mathieux.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fnico-mathieux\u002FaXoelgIvOtkhCCWF_Piste_de_Belizon-2.gpx","Piste_de_Belizon-2.gpx","47399441",{"link_type":32,"key":229,"url":230,"target":35},"20cd0416-625b-4ae4-a35e-a35a01e476cc","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.youtube.com\u002Fwatch?v=TU_3rHvkhig",[232,253,276,294,309,319],{"variation":101,"version":102,"items":233,"primary":234,"id":251,"slice_type":252,"slice_label":5},[],{"numbers":235,"shop_related":18},[236,239,243,247],{"number":237,"unit":5,"description":238},"4","Jours",{"number":240,"unit":241,"description":242},"152,13","km","Distance",{"number":244,"unit":245,"description":246},"5 984","D+","Dénivelé",{"number":248,"unit":249,"description":250},"33","°C","Température","numbers_list$3dc07c4c-8c54-4a98-bac0-4b5f473162d4","numbers_list",{"variation":101,"version":102,"items":254,"primary":255,"id":274,"slice_type":275,"slice_label":5},[],{"title":256,"subtitle":257,"text":258,"link":263,"image":267,"image_place":212,"image_date":221,"inverted":18,"shop_related":18},"À propos","01",[259],{"type":260,"text":261,"spans":262,"direction":79},"paragraph","La piste de Bélizon est une ancienne voie forestière emblématique de l’intérieur de la Guyane, construite en 1952 par le Bureau des Mines de Guyane pour relier la route nationale RN2 (depuis le lieu-dit Bélizon, sur la commune de Roura) jusqu’au village isolé de Saül, en plein cœur de la forêt amazonienne. L’objectif de cette piste de plus de 150 km était de soutenir l’exploitation aurifère à Saül, alors en plein essor.\n\nLe village de Saül lui-même est une petite commune forestière au centre de la Guyane, située dans une cuvette entourée de reliefs comme les monts Galbao et Belvédère. Sans voie routière stable vers l’extérieur, Saül est essentiellement accessible par avion",[],{"link_type":264,"key":265,"text":266},"Any","5a952a30-606e-44a7-ad18-90fd8406c126","Découvrir",{"dimensions":268,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":271,"id":272,"edit":273},{"width":269,"height":270},4240,2832,"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fnico-mathieux\u002FaXotfAIvOtkhCCjn_DSC07988.jpg?auto=format,compress","aXotfAIvOtkhCCjn",{"x":28,"y":28,"zoom":29,"background":30},"title_text_image$aea1b051-0eba-4589-9c65-6a1e116b7e7e","title_text_image",{"variation":101,"version":102,"items":277,"primary":278,"id":292,"slice_type":293,"slice_label":5},[],{"images":279,"shop_related":18},[280,286],{"image":281,"place":211,"date":221},{"dimensions":282,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":283,"id":284,"edit":285},{"width":270,"height":269},"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fnico-mathieux\u002FaXotwgIvOtkhCCjt_DSC08020-2.jpg?auto=format,compress","aXotwgIvOtkhCCjt",{"x":28,"y":28,"zoom":29,"background":30},{"image":287,"place":212,"date":221},{"dimensions":288,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":289,"id":290,"edit":291},{"width":269,"height":270},"https:\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fnico-mathieux\u002FaXotMwIvOtkhCCjg_DSC07929.jpg?auto=format,compress","aXotMwIvOtkhCCjg",{"x":28,"y":28,"zoom":29,"background":30},"image_carousel$55ca2ce9-2d09-4951-a911-675ca2b55013","image_carousel",{"variation":101,"version":102,"items":295,"primary":296,"id":307,"slice_type":308,"slice_label":5},[],{"left_image":297,"right_image":302,"shop_related":18},{"dimensions":298,"alt":5,"copyright"